# AI-Powered Movie Recommendation System 🎬
### End-to-End Medallion Architecture on Databricks

This repository contains a full-scale recommendation engine pipeline developed using **PySpark** and **Databricks**. The project follows the industry-standard **Medallion Architecture**, transitioning data from raw logs to high-value business insights.

---

## 🏗️ Project Architecture
The system is organized into four distinct stages to ensure data quality and scalability:

### 1. 📥 Ingestion (Raw)
- **Source:** MovieLens 1M Dataset.
- **Process:** Automated ingestion of `.dat` files into a unified Databricks Volume.
- **Tools:** Spark I/O, Databricks Volumes.

### 2. 🧹 Processing (Silver)
- **Cleaning:** Type casting, handling missing values, and deduplication.
- **EDA:** Exploratory Data Analysis to identify user behavior patterns and rating distributions.
- **Storage:** Data is persisted as Silver Delta tables for high-performance querying.

### 3. 🤖 Modeling (Gold)
- **Algorithm:** Collaborative Filtering using Alternating Least Squares (ALS).
- **Technical Bypass:** Due to environment restrictions, a custom **Baseline Average Model** was implemented to calculate **RMSE (Root Mean Squared Error)** using pure Spark SQL functions.
- **User Segmentation:** Applied statistical thresholds to categorize users into "Enthusiasts," "Power Users," and "Casuals."

### 4. 📊 Production (Dashboard)
- **Functionality:** A real-time "Top-N" recommendation lookup system.
- **Architecture:** Decoupled the production layer from the model training layer for maximum uptime and speed.

---

## 📂 Repository Structure
```text
├── 01_Ingestion/
│   └── 01_Cloud_Setup.ipynb        # Environment & Volume Configuration
├── 02_Processing/
